  (uuid_generate_v4(), 'red-turquoise-and-pearl-pendant-necklace-glass-accents-gold-tone-oval-link-state', '4614694306', 'https://www.etsy.com/listing/4614694306/red-turquoise-and-pearl-pendant-necklace?click_key=3dae72b2-8c6c-4fdc-a727-dda2bfe9b877%3ALT41858eff0303db7f40b78f4ea43d309a0f0147fa&click_sum=a51ca503&ls=s&ga_order=most_relevant&ga_search_type=all&ga_view_type=gallery&ga_search_query=turquoise+jewelry&ref=search_grid-37503-17-32&sr_prefetch=1&pf_from=search&pro=1&frs=1&sts=1&content_source=3dae72b2-8c6c-4fdc-a727-dda2bfe9b877%253ALT41858eff0303db7f40b78f4ea43d309a0f0147fa',
   'Red Turquoise and Pearl Pendant Necklace, Glass Accents, Gold-Tone Oval Link Statement Jewelry', '—————Details Description————— Material: Red Turquoise, Pearl Pendant: 27mm*36mm Length: 25 inches Weight: 85g 1. Jewelry Details 👐 Independently designed by TAMMY, this handmade necklace combines red turquoise, 7–8 mm pearls, amber-colored glass accents and open gold-tone oval links, finished with a hook clasp. Approx. measurements: pendant 36 × 27 mm; glass accents 17 mm; length 25 inches; weight 85 g. 2. Inspiration & Style ✨ Inspired by warm sunset colors and organic forms, veined red stones meet luminous pearls and sparkling glass. Sculptural frames, dangling charms and an asymmetric layout create an expressive bohemian statement. Designed for jewelry collectors, lovers of wearable art and admirers of independent design. Style with an open shirt or evening dress. A romantic gift for a partner 💑, an anniversary keepsake or a Christmas gift 🎁. 3. Care & Notes 💝 Colors, veining and pearl shapes vary; sizes are approximate. At 85 g, this necklace has a substantial feel. Avoid water, perfume, chemicals and impacts. Wipe with a soft cloth; store separately. Ask about red stone composition, treatments and metal details. 4. Wholesale 🎁 TAMMY welcomes boutiques and bulk gift orders. Contact us for wholesale pricing, minimum quantities, lead times and packaging options. ★Shopping Tips★: Please note that due to the unique nature of natural material, each jewelry is one-of-a-kind and may have minor imperfections, color variations, or natural fissures. The weight and length of the jewelry will also vary. These are normal occurrences with natural jewelry, serving as proof of their authenticity. About Shipping: We will ship within 3-5 business days, and you will receive a notification after the package is shipped. Delivery usually takes 10-15 business days. ❤Feel free to contact us anytime. Thank you for your support!❤', 'turquoise-jewelry',
