  (uuid_generate_v4(), 'new-blue-black-ceramic-pendant-2-beads-turquoise-disks-black-onyx-lucite-beads-s', '4456442960', 'https://www.etsy.com/listing/4456442960/new-blueblack-ceramic-pendant-2-beads?click_key=3dae72b2-8c6c-4fdc-a727-dda2bfe9b877%3ALT631e66b430f8dae1a58df45c2a32da33ed47e652&click_sum=ce413759&ls=s&ga_order=most_relevant&ga_search_type=all&ga_view_type=gallery&ga_search_query=turquoise+jewelry&ref=search_grid-37503-17-31&sr_prefetch=1&pf_from=search&content_source=3dae72b2-8c6c-4fdc-a727-dda2bfe9b877%253ALT631e66b430f8dae1a58df45c2a32da33ed47e652',
   'NEW! Blue/Black Ceramic Pendant & 2 Beads, Turquoise Disks, Black Onyx/Lucite Beads. Silver Clasp, Earrings, 20" Necklace, by SandraDesigns', 'Please read the entire description. This unusual necklace has a long ceramic pendant and two matching ceramic beads hand-crafted by Cornelia Jarst. The black beads include larger vintage lucite and smaller onyx. The disks are real turquoise as are the turquoise beads in the earrings and pendant. The earring wires are sterling silver. The sturdy hook-and-eye clasp is silver-plated. [I will take a photo of this on my mannequin as soon as I am able.] necklace: 20" (51cm) pendant: 3 3/4" (9.5cm) long Price includes earrings - 1 1/4" (3cm) long from bottom of hook Shipping is FREE in the U.S. This will be shipped priority mail, the safest and fastest way to ship jewelry (includes $100 insurance in U.S.) If you would like additional insurance (recommended), contact me BEFORE purchasing. The shipping fees for Canada and other INTERNATIONAL destinations are also for priority mail (includes insurance of item value up to $200.) However, shipping may be cheaper for international first class mail (no insurance.) Please contact me BEFORE purchasing if you prefer cheaper first class mail. For Canada, include postal code. Be sure to check out my other unique black/blue pieces in the section "Contemporary Designs." To see interesting vintage items - unusual home collectibles, travel treasures, jewelry, clothing, toys, masks, art and more, go to my other shop - SandraDestash.etsy.com.', 'turquoise-jewelry',
