  (uuid_generate_v4(), 'turquoise-dressed-in-pink-necklace', '4603789035', 'https://www.etsy.com/listing/4603789035/turquoise-dressed-in-pink-necklace?click_key=3dae72b2-8c6c-4fdc-a727-dda2bfe9b877%3ALT9fdf2eed9bb0dbd635e2f1bf459b0f5797cb36ae&click_sum=b01721d9&ls=s&ga_order=most_relevant&ga_search_type=all&ga_view_type=gallery&ga_search_query=turquoise+jewelry&ref=search_grid-37503-17-30&sr_prefetch=1&pf_from=search&sts=1&content_source=3dae72b2-8c6c-4fdc-a727-dda2bfe9b877%253ALT9fdf2eed9bb0dbd635e2f1bf459b0f5797cb36ae',
   'Turquoise Dressed in Pink Necklace', 'This beautiful necklace was a piece I made while teaching my Secrets Revealed Class. In the class I teach how to use fabric and layer components. The fabric I used was a wonderful stretchy velvet with a rich pink coloration. I layered a vintage button on top. Some sweet turquoise stones also adorn the piece along with bronze clay components. This one of a kind piece is just stunning I love the colors. The pendant measures 2.5 inches wide X 5 inches long. It hangs from a 20 inch beaded chain which can be easily shortened with lobster claw clasp.', 'turquoise-jewelry',
