  (uuid_generate_v4(), 'konplott-ring-cages-fireball-turquoise-blue-crystal-rhinestone-silver-antique-ad', '4614586219', 'https://www.etsy.com/listing/4614586219/konplott-ring-cages-fireball-turquoise?click_key=3dae72b2-8c6c-4fdc-a727-dda2bfe9b877%3ALT16e0461dd995663c70935507a0f598f8e9d27c25&click_sum=e57eb609&ls=s&ga_order=most_relevant&ga_search_type=all&ga_view_type=gallery&ga_search_query=turquoise+jewelry&ref=search_grid-37503-17-29&sr_prefetch=1&pf_from=search&content_source=3dae72b2-8c6c-4fdc-a727-dda2bfe9b877%253ALT16e0461dd995663c70935507a0f598f8e9d27c25',
   'Konplott Ring Cages Fireball Turquoise Blue Crystal Rhinestone Silver Antique Adjustable Designer Miranda Konstantinidou', 'This striking, wide band ring comes from the renowned jewelry manufacturer Konplott and embodies the unmistakable, playful style of designer Miranda Konstantinidou. Since the late 1980s, the label has stood for artful, handcrafted fashion jewelry that combines historical romance with modern opulence and showcases colorful crystals like miniature fireworks. The design is reminiscent of the brand''s popular "Magic Fireball" line: Several fine, organically curved metal wires wrap around your finger like an airy mesh. Embedded in this dark, antiqued silver finish, a vibrant arrangement of crystal glass stones of varying sizes sparkles. Matte, opaque turquoise tones (Pacific Opal) meet intensely luminous, faceted shades of blue and petrol, reflecting the light in a multifaceted way with every movement of your hand. A particularly practical detail is found on the back: The open, bundled wire ends make the ring adjustable and feature the original, round Konplott logo plaque. Material: Antique silver-plated brass (nickel-free), cut and opaque crystal glass stones Dimensions: Wide ring band look, flexibly adjustable in size thanks to the open rail on the back. Origin: Europe / Germany (Designer manufacturer Konplott by Miranda Konstantinidou, marked with logo plaque) Period: Contemporary designer vintage (approx. 2000s to 2010s) Condition: The ring is in very good, well-maintained condition. All turquoise and blue crystals are present, firmly set in their settings, and display a clear, undamaged sparkle. The antiqued wire mesh is sturdy and not bent, and the small Konplott maker''s mark on the back is intact.', 'turquoise-jewelry',
