  (uuid_generate_v4(), 'turquoise-pendant-natural-turquoise-oval-sterling-silver-pendant-1-1-inch', '4614455982', 'https://www.etsy.com/listing/4614455982/turquoise-pendant-natural-turquoise-oval?click_key=3dae72b2-8c6c-4fdc-a727-dda2bfe9b877%3ALTca25b1cf70204e0a38f19515f34c85aad647ad0f&click_sum=bf11c69e&ls=s&ga_order=most_relevant&ga_search_type=all&ga_view_type=gallery&ga_search_query=turquoise+jewelry&ref=search_grid-37503-17-28&sr_prefetch=1&pf_from=search&pro=1&frs=1&content_source=3dae72b2-8c6c-4fdc-a727-dda2bfe9b877%253ALTca25b1cf70204e0a38f19515f34c85aad647ad0f',
   'Turquoise Pendant — Natural Turquoise Oval Sterling Silver Pendant, 1.1 Inch', 'A sterling silver pendant with an oval natural turquoise cabochon in a smooth bezel. The stone is a clean, bright blue with just a touch of metallic matrix — natural and one of a kind. Pendant only — the chain is sold separately, so you can wear it on your favorite chain. About Turquoise: Turquoise is an opaque blue-green phosphate mineral treasured since ancient times — the pharaohs of Egypt wore it, and it has long been sacred to Native American cultures of the Southwest. Turquoise is December''s birthstone and is said to bring protection, good fortune, and calm, clear communication to its wearer. Details: - Stone: Natural turquoise - Metal: Sterling silver - Pendant length: 1.1 inch - Chain: Sold separately Note: Some photographs in this listing may have been generated or edited using AI tools.', 'turquoise-jewelry',
