  (uuid_generate_v4(), 'tideprint-turquoise-bolo-tie-cuttlefish-cast-sterling-silver-western-jewelry-one', '4565609057', 'https://www.etsy.com/listing/4565609057/tideprint-turquoise-bolo-tie-cuttlefish?click_key=3dae72b2-8c6c-4fdc-a727-dda2bfe9b877%3ALT314d6a87de87b4da63ca50f4630531076fab805a&click_sum=ae30a668&ls=s&ga_order=most_relevant&ga_search_type=all&ga_view_type=gallery&ga_search_query=turquoise+jewelry&ref=search_grid-37503-17-26&sr_prefetch=1&pf_from=search&frs=1&content_source=3dae72b2-8c6c-4fdc-a727-dda2bfe9b877%253ALT314d6a87de87b4da63ca50f4630531076fab805a',
   'Tideprint Turquoise Bolo Tie | Cuttlefish Cast Sterling Silver Western Jewelry | One-of-a-Kind Handmade Bolo', 'Details & Measurements Stone: Variscite with turquoise highlights Metal: Sterling silver Cord: Thin braided leather Cord length: 40 inches Weight: 48.2 grams Construction: Handcrafted sterling silver setting and handmade bolo tips Design: One-of-a-kind Western bolo tie The Story Behind Desert Current This bolo is built around a stone that caught my eye and my heart: variscite with beautiful turquoise highlights running through it. The flashes of blue within the green give the stone movement, making it look like water, with color that changes as you look across its surface. I kept the surrounding design focused on the stone, adding small turquoise adornments that pull the blue forward rather than compete with it. The 40-inch thin braided leather cord is finished with handcrafted sterling silver bolo tips, making the details at the ends part of the piece rather than an afterthought. This is one of my favorite bolos—a substantial, one-of-a-kind piece made for someone who wants the stone itself to be the reason the jewelry exists.', 'turquoise-jewelry',
