  (uuid_generate_v4(), 'vintage-sterling-silver-turquoise-and-coral-drop-earrings-by-amy', '4345095168', 'https://www.etsy.com/listing/4345095168/vintage-sterling-silver-turquoise-and?click_key=3dae72b2-8c6c-4fdc-a727-dda2bfe9b877%3ALT9d5ee00ebec0076ed4d64d5909ab3ed1e132c045&click_sum=5424880c&ls=s&ga_order=most_relevant&ga_search_type=all&ga_view_type=gallery&ga_search_query=turquoise+jewelry&ref=search_grid-37503-17-10&sr_prefetch=1&pf_from=search&pro=1&sts=1&content_source=3dae72b2-8c6c-4fdc-a727-dda2bfe9b877%253ALT9d5ee00ebec0076ed4d64d5909ab3ed1e132c045',
   'Vintage Sterling Silver Turquoise and Coral Drop Earrings by Amy', 'Up for your consideration is a striking pair of vintage drop earrings handcrafted in the 1970s by the artisan Amy. These earrings showcase a bold and colorful inlay design, meticulously crafted in sterling silver and featuring vibrant turquoise and red coral stones arranged in a captivating curved pattern. Each earring begins with a round turquoise stud, followed by a suspended marquise-shaped dangle that is inlaid with alternating turquoise and coral segments, forming a mesmerizing spiral-like motif. The intricate inlay work and precise silver channels reflect a high level of craftsmanship, emblematic of the era’s finest handmade jewelry. The earrings measure approximately 1 1/2 inches in length by 1/2 inch in width, offering a graceful drop and a perfect balance of color and shape. The combination of turquoise and coral evokes classic Southwestern aesthetics, making them an ideal addition for collectors or vintage jewelry lovers. These earrings are both elegant and eye-catching, embodying the spirit of 1970s artisan jewelry with their unique design and timeless materials.', 'turquoise-jewelry',
