  (uuid_generate_v4(), 'jaya-antique-turquoise-stone-rakhi-thread-presented-on-a-luxury-backing-board-wi', '1047975375', 'https://www.etsy.com/listing/1047975375/jaya-antique-turquoise-stone-rakhi?click_key=3dae72b2-8c6c-4fdc-a727-dda2bfe9b877%3ALT49b65cd153023a6c8e8f3963cffac9bba1d5dc68&click_sum=f9520fee&ls=s&ga_order=most_relevant&ga_search_type=all&ga_view_type=gallery&ga_search_query=turquoise+jewelry&ref=search_grid-1019173-17-7&sr_prefetch=1&pf_from=search&content_source=3dae72b2-8c6c-4fdc-a727-dda2bfe9b877%253ALT49b65cd153023a6c8e8f3963cffac9bba1d5dc68',
   'Jaya Antique Turquoise Stone Rakhi Thread Presented on a luxury backing board with special words', 'A unique & stylish Rakhri design to mark the occasion in style. Each Rakhri is sourced with careful attention and hand packed to offer my customers a wonderful gifting experience. Rakhri bead size 1.7cm approx Thread length 35cm approx All Rakhri''s are hand packed with love and care they are fantastic for slipping into greeting cards. * Each Rakhri holds it own special message as below on a backed board. *Larger size Rakhis or Bracelets will be boxed with a gift card included with the message below. Happy Raksha Bandhan: RAKHI IS THE THREAD THAT BINDS TWO SOULS IN A BOND OF JOY FOREVER. TODAY I AM SENDING THIS THREAD TO REMEMBER THE JOY,THE SPECIAL TIE WE SHARE AND WISHING YOU HAPPINESS AND GOOD LUCK FOREVER! Unit Size 110mm x 110mm square/ ideal for posting Raksha Bandhan, also abbreviated to Rakhi, is the Hindu/Sikh festival that celebrates brotherhood and love. It is celebrated on the full moon in the month of Sravana in the lunar calendar. Each product shown is a representation of the actual product. I attempt to display product images as accurately as possible. However, due to lighting and different devices you might be using, the colour in the image may vary slightly for the actual colour of the product. Please review all the images of the product you desire BEFORE placing your order. If you have any questions about any of my products please feel free to contact me by clicking the contact form. Customer satisfaction is my number one priority, and I will gladly provide more information on any of my products because I want you to feel confident about your purchase with me at Eastern Print Studio. Thank you for supporting a small business Eastern Print Studio Thank you Gurinder (Eastern Print Studio) PLEASE READ CAREFULLY BEFORE YOUR PURCHASE Rakhri is on Monday 19th August 2024 Last date for international orders is Friday 2nd August Last date for UK orders is Friday 9nd August No items are sent tracked unless upgraded all items are sent Royal Mail 2nd class. Rak', 'turquoise-jewelry',
