  (uuid_generate_v4(), 'handmade-turquoise-statement-ring-sterling-silver-artisan-ring-sculptural-two-st', '4614343383', 'https://www.etsy.com/listing/4614343383/handmade-turquoise-statement-ring?click_key=3dae72b2-8c6c-4fdc-a727-dda2bfe9b877%3ALT854d9d5404a18f8bfef425d96eb9d65b0bb0342a&click_sum=7f74a9ac&ls=s&ga_order=most_relevant&ga_search_type=all&ga_view_type=gallery&ga_search_query=turquoise+jewelry&ref=search_grid-1019173-17-6&sr_prefetch=1&pf_from=search&sts=1&content_source=3dae72b2-8c6c-4fdc-a727-dda2bfe9b877%253ALT854d9d5404a18f8bfef425d96eb9d65b0bb0342a',
   'Handmade Turquoise Statement Ring, Sterling Silver Artisan Ring, Sculptural Two Stone Design', 'Bold, sculptural, and unmistakably handmade, this sterling silver and turquoise statement ring is an original design from our jewelry studio. The design began as a ring I created for myself, and it quickly became one of my personal favorites. After receiving so many compliments whenever I wore it, I decided it was time to offer this unique design to our customers. Featuring two individually selected turquoise cabochons, this substantial ring combines angular lines, softly rounded details, and a striking asymmetrical silhouette. Every element is thoughtfully arranged to create a piece that feels both contemporary and timeless. Entirely handcrafted in our Arizona studio, the setting is individually fabricated from sterling silver sheet and wire. The distinctive split shank is carefully cut by hand with a jeweler''s saw, while the decorative silver balls are individually formed by hand and incorporated into the design. No two rings will be exactly alike, making each one a unique piece of wearable art. DETAILS Metal: Solid .925 sterling silver Gemstones: Two Blue Mohave turquoise cabochons, as identified by our gemstone supplier Ring face: Approximately 54 mm long × 27 mm wide (2.13″ × 1.06″) Ring band: 6 mm wide, low-dome sterling silver Shank: Hand-sawed split-shank design Silver accents: Individually hand-formed sterling silver balls measuring just over 4 mm each Construction: Hand-fabricated, soldered, stone-set, and finished Sizing: Made to order in your selected ring size Origin: Handmade in Arizona, USA YOUR TURQUOISE, YOUR RING The ring pictured is my original design and serves as an example of the finished piece you will receive. Because each ring is made individually, yours will feature its own pair of beautiful turquoise cabochons, with unique colors, shapes, and matrix patterns. **Before we begin fabrication, we''ll send you photographs of the available turquoise stones so you can see and approve the pair that will be used in your ring.** Once your stones are ', 'turquoise-jewelry',
