  (uuid_generate_v4(), 'hubei-turquoise-split-shank-ring', '4509708252', 'https://www.etsy.com/listing/4509708252/hubei-turquoise-split-shank-ring?click_key=3dae72b2-8c6c-4fdc-a727-dda2bfe9b877%3ALTa1c2f5f2b61b7e2552c9c31a2b1c4e3467c1b850&click_sum=557e36bc&ls=s&ga_order=most_relevant&ga_search_type=all&ga_view_type=gallery&ga_search_query=turquoise+jewelry&ref=search_grid-1019173-17-1&sr_prefetch=1&pf_from=search&frs=1&sts=1&content_source=3dae72b2-8c6c-4fdc-a727-dda2bfe9b877%253ALTa1c2f5f2b61b7e2552c9c31a2b1c4e3467c1b850',
   'Hubei Turquoise Split Shank Ring', 'Product Description Make a bold yet classic statement with this handcrafted turquoise statement ring. This striking piece features a stunning turquoise cabochon from Hubei Province, China that is celebrated for its unique character and intricate patterns, making it perfect for the wearer who loves one-of-a-kind, artisan jewelry. The star of this ring is a 6.7ct natural Hubei turquoise stone. The stone is securely nestled in a fine silver serrated bezel, which is surrounded by a sleek sterling silver shadowbox border that has been subtly oxidized to create contrast and depth. The entire setting sits comfortably on a split-shank sterling silver band, beautifully balancing the substantial size of the ring face while providing a secure fit for daily wear. ✨ Key Features Gemstone: Genuine Hubei Province turquoise cabochon Size: US Ring Size 8 Metals: Bezel: Fine Silver (99.9% pure silver) Ring Band & Backplate: Sterling Silver (925) Design: Elongated oval shadowbox setting with a comfortable split-shank band Finish: Polished silver with selective oxidation to highlight the stone''s borders Style: Southwest, Artisan, Boho, Statement, Classic Turquoise 🎁 Perfect Gift For December birthdays (Turquoise is the traditional birthstone) Collectors of unique, matrix-rich natural turquoise varieties Anyone who loves bold, everyday statement rings A special milestone gift, or a timeless addition to a bohemian wardrobe 🌟 My Promise on Craftsmanship & Pricing Welcome to my journey as a newly emerging silversmith! Each piece you see here is handcrafted with passion, dedication, and a commitment to high-quality materials, including sterling and fine silver. As I continue to hone my craft, you may notice that some elements—such as the precision of bezels, the exactness of solder joints, or the overall finish tightness—may reflect that I am still early in my training, perfecting techniques that take decades to master. This is a unique opportunity for you: Because my current craftsmanshi', 'turquoise-jewelry',
