  (uuid_generate_v4(), 'palomino-turquoise-ring-925-sterling-silver-pear-shape-party-wear-jewelry', '4551504928', 'https://www.etsy.com/listing/4551504928/palomino-turquoise-ring-925-sterling?click_key=EuslJBqaIzsPErOOexVCqDwaaz29%3ALT5739c6eaf58a919fecf38ace9029a045c71b2362&click_sum=052a826c&ls=a&ga_order=most_relevant&ga_search_type=all&ga_view_type=gallery&ga_search_query=turquoise+jewelry&ref=search_grid-1019172-17-1&sr_prefetch=1&pf_from=search&pro=1&frs=1&cns=1',
   'Palomino Turquoise Ring 925 Sterling Silver Pear Shape Party Wear Jewelry', 'Silver Wedding Ring. Note: As natural gemstones are unique, slight variations in color, pattern, texture, and appearance may occur compared to the image shown. No two natural gemstones are exactly identical. ------------------------------------------ Welcome to Our Shop SilverartisianUSA ------------------------------------------ Palomino Turquoise Ring handcrafted in genuine 925 Sterling Silver, featuring a natural Palomino Turquoise gemstone in an elegant pear shape. Its distinctive earthy tones and natural matrix give every stone a unique character, while the classic silver setting creates a timeless artisan look. ✨ Details: • Natural Palomino Turquoise • Genuine 925 Sterling Silver • Elegant Pear Shape design • Handcrafted Rings by skilled artisans • Beautiful Dainty Silver Ring style • Perfect Silver Wedding Ring option • Lovely Anniversary Jewelry gift • Suitable for everyday or special occasions Natural turquoise may vary slightly in color, matrix, and veining, making each ring uniquely yours. SKU:- SH-764 Metal:- Sterling Silver Metal Purity:- 925 Gemstone:- Palomino Turquoise Gemstone Color:- Yellow Gemstone Shape :- Pear Gemstone Creation :- Natural ♥ A PERSONALIZED TOUCH TO TREASURE ♥ Make every piece of jewelry uniquely yours with customizable birthstones and gemstones. Whether you love dainty hearts, twinkling stars, or a sleek minimalist design, our collection lets you express your personal style effortlessly. Handcrafted by SilverartisianUSA, our sterling silver jewelry is hypoallergenic, nickel-free, and lead-free, ensuring comfort and safety for all skin types. ♥ THE PERFECT GIFT FOR EVERY OCCASION ♥ Celebrate life’s most cherished moments with a gift that speaks from the heart. Whether it’s a birthday, anniversary, engagement, or wedding, our jewelry symbolizes love, appreciation, and elegance. Surprise your mother on Mother’s Day, your best friend on Christmas, or your partner on Valentine’s Day with a keepsake they’ll treasure forever. ♥ ELEGANCE', 'turquoise-jewelry',
