   'Big Statement Earrings in Teal & Orange, Polymer Clay Earrings Hand Painted, Large Square Hoops Stud or Clip On Earrings, Retro 80s Jewelry', 'Bring bold color and modern style to your look with these handmade square statement earrings in teal and orange. Each pair is carefully crafted from lightweight polymer clay, giving you a chunky, eye-catching design that feels comfortable to wear all day. The two-tone painted finish adds a trendy artistic touch, making these earrings a unique accessory for everyday outfits, special occasions, or gifting. Available in multiple colors as both post or clip on earrings. Measurements: * Earrings- 2 inches long and 1.2 inch wide Materials: * Professional grade polymer clay * Alcohol ink * Gloss coating * Stainless steel post or clip ons Sassy Sacha Jewelry is handmade with love in my workshop in Halifax, NS, Canada. My goal is to create bright, colorful, bold pieces of jewelry that radiant your beauty and confidence. Sassy Sacha Jewelry is perfect for women who have an adventurous style and like to stand out as their amazing self. Be Bright, Be Bold and Have Fun. Explore my full shop here - https://www.etsy.com/shop/sassysachajewelry Thank you for taking an interest in my handmade jewelry store. Cheers, Sacha You can also follow my social media accounts here (I sometimes share special coupons): Facebook- https://www.facebook.com/sassysachajewelry Pinterest- https://www.pinterest.com/sassysachajewelry Instagram- https://www.instragam.com/sassysachajewelry For exclusive discount codes sign up to my newsletter here- https://mailchi.mp/b4b63543aa8d/sassysacha', 'turquoise-jewelry',
