  (uuid_generate_v4(), 'sterling-silver-sonoran-gold-y-necklace-turquoise-heart-pendant-southwestern-sta', '4614642259', 'https://www.etsy.com/listing/4614642259/sterling-silver-sonoran-gold-y-necklace?click_key=c065112a-15db-4334-805f-33d9023ef7d2%3ALT2ab0cb750003cbb89f86ba09ac75d5fbe1c659a2&click_sum=06375946&ls=s&ga_order=most_relevant&ga_search_type=all&ga_view_type=gallery&ga_search_query=turquoise+jewelry&ref=search_grid-970641-16-44&sr_prefetch=1&pf_from=search&pro=1&frs=1&sts=1&content_source=c065112a-15db-4334-805f-33d9023ef7d2%253ALT2ab0cb750003cbb89f86ba09ac75d5fbe1c659a2',
   'Sterling Silver Sonoran Gold Y Necklace, Turquoise Heart Pendant, Southwestern Statement Jewelry', 'Add a beautiful Southwestern touch to your jewelry collection with this eye-catching 925 Sterling Silver Sonoran Gold Y Necklace. Designed with a stunning combination of blue, turquoise-green, and golden-matrix Sonoran Gold stones, this unique necklace features a graceful V-shaped arrangement with a beautiful heart-shaped center gemstone and a cascading Y-shaped drop. Each gemstone is individually set in decorative sterling silver bezels, creating an elegant combination of colorful natural stone patterns and artisan-inspired silverwork. The heart-shaped centerpiece adds a romantic touch, while the dangling gemstone accents create movement and make this necklace a striking statement accessory. Whether styled with a casual outfit, bohemian dress, Western-inspired fashion, or special occasion attire, this Sonoran Gold necklace brings distinctive Southwestern charm to your look. PRODUCT DETAILS Product: Sonoran Gold Y Necklace Metal: 925 Sterling Silver Gemstone: Sonoran Gold Stone Stone Colors: Turquoise Blue, Green, Golden Matrix Pendant Design: V-Shaped Multi-Stone Necklace Center Stone: Heart-Shaped Gemstone Drop Design: Cascading Y-Shaped Gemstone Dangles Stone Setting: Decorative Silver Bezel Setting Chain Style: Sterling Silver Link Chain Closure: Lobster Clasp (verify before publishing) Style: Southwestern, Bohemian, Western, Artisan Gender: Women UNIQUE DESIGN FEATURES : Beautiful multicolor Sonoran Gold gemstones. Eye-catching heart-shaped center stone. Elegant cascading Y-shaped pendant design. Multiple blue and green gemstone accents. Decorative sterling silver bezel settings. Delicate silver chain with adjustable extension (if applicable). A distinctive statement necklace for gemstone jewelry lovers. PERFECT GIFT FOR HER : Make someone feel special with this unique gemstone necklace. A wonderful gift choice for: Birthday gifts Anniversary gifts Valentine''s Day Mother''s Day Christmas gifts Bridesmaid gifts Southwestern jewelry collectors Turquoise and gemsto', 'statement-pieces',
