   'Natural Turquoise Cabochon – Genuine Loose Gemstone for Jewelry Making, 13x10x5 mm', 'Natural Turquoise Cabochon – Genuine Loose Gemstone for Jewelry Making, 13x10x5 mm ITEM DETAILS: GEMSTONE - Arizona turquoise SHAPE - Pear WEIGHT - 3.70 carats DIMENSIONS - 13x10x5 MM ORIGIN - Arizona TREATMENT - No COLOR - Blue Note: ⚠️ This decoration is made from high-quality natural crystal, each piece showcasing unique natural patterns and beautiful colors. Due to the nature of natural crystals, there may be some natural scratches, which is a normal occurrence and reflects the uniqueness and natural charm of each crystal. All product images are taken from the actual items, ensuring that the product you receive matches what is shown. We guarantee no false advertising. 🎁After purchase, we will randomly ship the products, giving every customer a unique surprise. ABOUT SHIPPING The item will be shipped via Standard Shipping AND this may arrive within 7-12 days & depending on your location That there may be occasional delays of 7-12 days About Wholesale & Custom Orders: 🛠️ We operate a manual factory, so wholesale and custom orders are available. The more you order, the more you save! 💰 Please feel free to contact us for more details. Customer Support: 💎 All our crystals are made from natural gemstones. If you have any questions or issues, please don''t hesitate to contact us via the message system 📩, and we will assist you promptly THAKS FOR CHOOSING MASIRAGEMS', 'turquoise-jewelry',
