  (uuid_generate_v4(), 'blue-butterfly-wing-earrings-transparent-resin-dangle-earrings-lightweight-fairy', '1114715752', 'https://www.etsy.com/listing/1114715752/blue-butterfly-wing-earrings-transparent?click_key=c065112a-15db-4334-805f-33d9023ef7d2%3ALT75316a1a113cf01cf5ff464594ce5d20cfa241c5&click_sum=40358522&ls=s&ga_order=most_relevant&ga_search_type=all&ga_view_type=gallery&ga_search_query=turquoise+jewelry&ref=search_grid-970641-16-29&sr_prefetch=1&pf_from=search&pro=1&frs=1&content_source=c065112a-15db-4334-805f-33d9023ef7d2%253ALT75316a1a113cf01cf5ff464594ce5d20cfa241c5&variation1=2719451186',
   'Blue Butterfly Wing Earrings – Transparent Resin Dangle Earrings – Lightweight Fairycore Jewelry', 'Bright blue butterfly wings with deep sapphire undertones and a clear, glass like epoxy resin finish. The smooth surface reflects light naturally, giving the wings depth and clarity without any coating or haze. These butterfly wing earrings are lightweight and comfortable to wear. The solid transparent resin preserves the layered wing design inside, creating a vivid blue look that feels clean, crisp, and expressive. Designed as an original butterfly wing jewelry piece, they add a calm magical accent without looking flashy. The blue tone is timeless and versatile, easy to style with everyday outfits, fairycore aesthetics, and nature inspired looks throughout the year. They also make a thoughtful gift for someone who loves butterflies, blue tones, and meaningful jewelry — a piece that feels personal and elegant rather than seasonal or generic. Wing size without hook Small — 1¼ in · 3.2 cm Big — 2 in · 5 cm Gift ready packaging included. Manufacturer(s): Love Nature Gifts Country of origin: Bulgaria Contact: handmadecreations [!at] mail.bg Product safety: Not suitable for children under 14 years. Small parts may present a choking hazard. Keep away from heat, moisture, perfumes, and chemicals. Avoid placing in the mouth or contact with food surfaces. Store separately to prevent scratches or damage.', 'turquoise-jewelry',
